;;; the spectral theorem for a compact self-adjoint operator on a Hilbert space, in the form Mercer
;;; and Karhunen-Loeve use.  Agent TH3-A4, wave 2026-11-09/10.
;;; Destination: theorem-library/th3a4-spectral.scm, after th3a3-spectral.  Library: operator-algebras.
;;; Helper prefix tqf- (the tqd- helpers of TH3-A3, copied: helpers do not cross file environments).
;;; Every qed modulo 0; nothing asserted.
;;;   (D1) density: sa-eigen-span-dense, sa-eigen-perp-perp, sa-eigen-closed-span
;;;   (D2) eigenspace-submodule, eigen-canon-onb
;;;   (D3) sa-eigen-onb (Cor 3.3, any Hilbert space, no separability)
;;;   (D4) bop-hom-ag, bop-sums-to (a bounded operator commutes with an unordered sum)
;;;   (D5) op-eigen-expansion (T x = sum lam_i <x|e_i> e_i over an eigenbasis)
;;;   (D6) ord-nn-in-segment-of-infinite, infinite-set-nn-injection (core), ip-unit-norm-one,
;;;        compact-eigen-large-finite (lam_k -> 0), compact-eigen-nonzero-countable (3.1 (i))
